# Parking sensor
# Level 3 - Sensors and motors
#
# Beeps faster the closer you get, and keeps beeping when you are very close - like a car's parking sensor.
# You learn: scale() between different units (centimetres into milliseconds) and clamp().
# You need: an HC-SR04 (Trig pin 7, Echo pin 8) and a piezo buzzer from pin 3 to GND.

board uno
use mujard.ultrasonic

sonar  = Ultrasonic(trig: pin 7, echo: pin 8)
buzzer = pin 3 as output

task beeper:
    while true:
        var d = sonar.distance()
        if d == none or d > 100 cm:
            wait 200 ms            # far away: stay quiet
        elif d < 10 cm:
            buzzer.tone(1 kHz, 100 ms)
            wait 100 ms            # very close: one long beep
        else:
            var gap = scale(clamp(d, 10 cm..100 cm), 10 cm..100 cm, 50 ms..800 ms)
            buzzer.tone(1 kHz, 50 ms)
            wait 50 ms + gap
